        "{\"event\":{\"at\":\"2026-11-03T20:52:14.900Z\",\"kind\":\"decision.recorded\",\"payload\":{\"adr\":\"ADR-2\",\"alternatives\":\"Strip a bare `export ` prefix with no lookahead: simpler, but `export = 1` would stop meaning a key named `export` and become a skipped line, a silent change to an existing input. Parse shell syntax properly (`export A=1 B=2`, `export -n`, escapes): out of scope for a plain stdlib-only accessor and not asked for. Strip `export` case-insensitively: the shell keyword is lowercase only, so `Export X=1` stays a key named `Export X`.\",\"rationale\":\"`export KEY=value` is read as `KEY=value`. The prefix is `export` plus spaces or tabs, removed after the line is trimmed, and only when the next character is neither whitespace nor `=` (regex `^export[ \\\\t]+(?=[^\\\\s=])`). That keeps `export = 1`, `export=1` and `exportKEY=2` meaning what they meant before, so the change adds a form and takes none away. `[ \\\\t]` is spelled out, not `\\\\s`, so JS and PHP match the same characters (JS `\\\\s` is wider than PCRE `\\\\s` without /u). Made in `packages/js` and `packages/php` in the same change, as ADR-1 requires, with the same two tests in each.\",\"title\":\"EnvAccessor strips a leading `export` only when a key follows it, in both packages\"},\"run\":\"01a1a32e-ac64-7000-94de-560791e80024\",\"signerFp\":\"7d41a9a200e26800891009841e0ccee4c910ba560ca328be3ed171473f62a3f5\",\"subject\":\"01a1a32f-17aa-7000-8763-9bb847df77f5\",\"v\":1,\"which\":\"claude-code\",\"who\":\"mnid:e5c436c24662dec000a3440683bc839da04a0ad6460e04fb589b3c0de48daa71\"},\"link\":{\"hash\":\"3d25d7c01bd794c9fccc03411a2d0d273ec1fd0f148b552a3f7f0426372f8074\",\"prev\":\"72bddcb61002427cc441bb73c766a9e0de40018c4b389df35b2d262b39eb3d8e\",\"seq\":3,\"tail\":\"7d41a9a200e26800891009841e0ccee4c910ba560ca328be3ed171473f62a3f5-a6c3133e212f29a79b4772a65620d780\"}}",
        "{\"event\":{\"at\":\"2026-11-03T20:52:14.900Z\",\"kind\":\"decision.transitioned\",\"payload\":{\"action\":\"create\",\"from\":null,\"to\":\"proposed\"},\"run\":\"01a1a32e-ac64-7000-94de-560791e80024\",\"signerFp\":\"7d41a9a200e26800891009841e0ccee4c910ba560ca328be3ed171473f62a3f5\",\"subject\":\"01a1a32f-17aa-7000-8763-9bb847df77f5\",\"v\":1,\"which\":\"claude-code\",\"who\":\"mnid:e5c436c24662dec000a3440683bc839da04a0ad6460e04fb589b3c0de48daa71\"},\"link\":{\"hash\":\"1d89e2c839fbda93b4dac34311002ade950d65a40593339bfe6eaed3b2830e47\",\"prev\":\"3d25d7c01bd794c9fccc03411a2d0d273ec1fd0f148b552a3f7f0426372f8074\",\"seq\":4,\"tail\":\"7d41a9a200e26800891009841e0ccee4c910ba560ca328be3ed171473f62a3f5-a6c3133e212f29a79b4772a65620d780\"}}",
